<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Credit Institute rejects six-month bids.</title>
<headline>Portugal Credit Institute rejects six-month bids.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute for Public Credit Management (IGCP) rejected bids on Monday at its offer to sell 15 billion escudos of six-month bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The average yield was 5.4698 percent at the last such sale on June 19.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
